    "body": "Bounded ff delivery with independent review. Implemented #390: issue-stage GitHub failures now retain a bounded, redacted denial reason when safe, without changing HTTP status or failure behavior. Focused tests, repository verification, strict OpenSpec validation and citation checks passed locally; repository tests included nine skips. The trusted host will independently check the candidate; current-head forge CI and separate integration authorization remain later gates.\n\nRefs #390.\n\nNext: complete the candidate and its checks. [Run and evidence](https://github.com/juangcarmona/lighthouse/actions/runs/42027266558).\n\n<!-- lighthouse-implementation:f92658f36c998605df23e26a7e3155a2616ff353440e0070971f1fdbfacd48fd -->",
